==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[Master Teasonai]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Trusted''' with the [[Ostron]]s.

==Notes==

* Direct finisher kills performed by {{WF|Ash}}'s {{A|Blade Storm}} (ability itself must kill, <u>'''NOT'''</u> the {{D|Slash}} proc) can trigger this mod's invisibility effect.

